31:05.865 --> 31:07.116
Well, gusto ko ang iyong damit.

31:07.117 --> 31:08.493
- Salamat.

31:08.618 --> 31:11.579
[tawa]

31:18.044 --> 31:20.421
- Well, nagtataka ako,

31:20.422 --> 31:22.297
dahil nakasuot ka
tulad ni Elphie,

31:22.298 --> 31:24.800
Gusto mo bang maging Elphie ko
para sa susunod na kanta, please?

31:24.801 --> 31:27.469
- Oo.

31:27.470 --> 31:28.887
- Maraming salamat.

31:28.888 --> 31:30.557
Oh, my goodness,
sobrang nasasabik ako.

31:30.682 --> 31:32.517
Halika dito.
salamat po.

31:32.642 --> 31:34.018
Hi.

31:34.019 --> 31:36.938
[tagalak at palakpakan]

31:38.690 --> 31:40.150
Hi.

31:40.275 --> 31:42.443
Oh, Diyos ko.
Ikinagagalak kitang makilala.

31:42.444 --> 31:43.611
Halika dito.

31:48.616 --> 31:51.494
Pakialam mo ba kung ako--

31:51.619 --> 31:53.788
